		@see [Feathers UI User Manual: Themes](https://feathersui.com/learn/haxe-openfl/themes/)

		@since 1.0.0
	**/
	public static final VARIANT_BORDER = "border";

	/**
		The variant used to style the tree view's item renderers in a theme.

